convention `v = −u`: `v'' + c₁ v' + c₂ v − v² = c₃ cos t` with
`(c₁, c₂, c₃) = (0, −1, −4/5)`.

GENERATED by
`exterior/tmp/lp_api_campaign_20261017/POST_MERGE/promotion_20261104/U-B/gen/fb1/gen_data.py`
(sha256 `519ff93bc55cd0fcba290f00e273b6c493fefc2f0222b28211cf99e3450ffb1f`), the trial generator
